    "verdict_notes": "Only 7B results are shown; no numbers are transcribed, and all values are read from figures. Knowledge accuracy uses exact-match QA, so chance is about 0 and 'reaches zero' counts as near chance. Not an original source. Tranche could arguably be T2; T3 is chosen for the new task settings. The reader's 'challenges' label was changed to limits_scope: forgetting succeeded, but at a utility cost the version says it shouldn't have."
